ely. A separate 5% applies only to job work done for a jeweller, not to a customer's purchase.","sources":[{"name":"GST Council: Sectoral FAQ, Gems & Jewellery","url":"https://gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2024-02/sectoral-fq-gems-jewellery.pdf"},{"name":"West Bengal Commercial Taxes: FAQ on Gems & Jewellery under GST","url":"https://comtax.wb.gov.in/GST/GST_FAQ/FAQ_on_Gems_&_Jewellery_under_GST.pdf"}]},"duty":{"rate_pct":15,"previous_pct":6,"since":"2026-05-13","en":"Import duty on gold and silver went up from 6% to 15% on 13 May 2026 (reported as 10% basic customs duty + 5% agriculture cess). We found no change after that as of 22 Nov 2026.","sources":[{"name":"News On AIR (Prasar Bharati): Government raises import duty on gold and precious metals","url":"https://newsonair.gov.in/government-raises-import-duty-on-gold-and-precious-metals-from-today"},{"name":"World Gold Council: India gold market update, import tightening (22 May 2026)","url":"https://www.gold.org/goldhub/gold-focus/2026/05/india-gold-market-update-import-tightening"}],"pass_through":{"gold_slope":0.98,"silver_slope":0.83,"period":"2000-01 to 2025-26","en":"In RBI yearly data since 2000-01, each 1 point of gold import duty lined up with about 1 point more in India's price over the world price (about 0.8 for silver).","source":{"name":"Our research report (RBI Handbook data), section on duty and premium","url":"data/research/India%20gold%20silver%20prices%2080%20years.md"}}},"huid":{"en":"Since 1 April 2023, hallmarked gold jewellery must carry a 6-character HUID code. You can check it for free in the official BIS CARE app (\"Verify HUID\"). Silver HUID hallmarking is voluntary.","sources":[{"name":"BIS: Hallmarking FAQ (HUID)","url":"https://www.bis.gov.in/hallmarking-overview/hallmarking-faqs/hallmarking-faq"},{"name":"PIB: sale without 6-digit HUID prohibited after 31 March 2023","url":"https://consumeraffairs.nic.in/sites/default/files/PIB1904262.pdf"},{"name":"BIS: consumer protection, 